        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Disposal, building, glazing 2-IV, U&lt;1.1W/m2K, LSG, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Disposal, building, glazing 2-IV, U&lt;1.1W/m2K, LSG, to final disposal
This dataset is applied for the disposal of 2-IV glazing (LSG) of windows. ;
UUID: 902ac640-1b5b-4574-9250-853f044c57cf
The dataset describes the disposal of 1.06 m2 double glazing 2-IV (laminated safety glass) in a municipal incineration. 80% of the glass goes for landfill, 20% to MSWI. 1.06m2 corresponds to 1m2 visible glass.
Location: Data estimated according to Swiss practice.
Technology: The technology described involves the disposal of aluminium, rubber and glass of a 2-IV glazing (LSG) in a municipal incineration plant (glass is partly landfilled).
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Calculation from waste composition 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that this dataset is representative for the whole Europe is taken into account in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_902ac640-1b5b-4574-9250-853f044c57cf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
